<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    What MilO's file provider (AndroidManifest.xml) may hand to another app: the files in the
    folder "reports" of the app's cache, and nothing else. That folder holds the PDF and CSV
    reports for the accountant (data/report/ReportFileStore, which names the same folder) and,
    once Shawn has shared it from the Log screen, the event log as a text file
    (data/eventlog/EventLogFiles).

    cache-path is the app's cache folder. Android never backs it up, and may empty it when the
    phone runs out of room; a report can be made again at any time.

    Never widen this to path="." or add another entry without reading the manifest's comment:
    whatever is listed here can leave the phone.
-->
<paths>
    <cache-path
        name="reports"
        path="reports/" />
</paths>
